<title>UK: IBCA confirms Nordbanken ratings.</title>
<headline>IBCA confirms Nordbanken ratings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Thursday it confirmed Nordbanken's A plus long-term rating and A1 short-term rating following the banks's announcement of a 5.0 billion Swedish crown share redemption.  </p>
<p>&quot;Although capital ratios will be reduced by the redemption, Nordbanken's financial condition remains strong,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
